speechtext:
The lists are what I described them to be when I tabled them. They contain the civil employees of the Department of National Defence in the three armed services according to classification, wage group, the number of both permanent and temporary employees, and then the total wage for each

Supply-National Defence group. The total of the prevailing rates employees is also given. They are classified in four parts: 1. Administration; 2. Navy;
3.	Army; 4. Defence research. That is what the lists are, and they are available, as I so indicated, and we will have photostatic copies made which can be used by the parties.
